; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "T" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>The residents' register... 
{PAUSE ""}
And this... a cosplay mail-order catalog...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In the living room</STYLE>, I was rummaging through <STYLE ID="2">Grandma's</STYLE> storage box without asking, but nothing worth noting turned up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was searching for something I'd really rather not find, but I was also scared of turning up things I didn't want to find in a different sense.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
See? There it is...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\エデン\コスプレ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "500" "C" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
This is from last year's Comiket, when <STYLE ID="2">Grandma</STYLE> dragged me to the cosplay hall.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The photos from that day were filed in a pretty album, one by one, with care.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, how's it going? Finding anything?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... I don't know... Is everything all right outside?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, looks like </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> went off somewhere on the buggy. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Probably the supermarket in Toyotake."</STYLE><PG>
I had <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE> keeping watch outside as my helper.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kana's</STYLE> eyesight and animal instincts are more reliable than anything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Though what <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE> makes of what I'm doing is another question...<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, why are you going through </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Grandma's</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> stuff?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE> and I had a huge fight at New Year's.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The reason: I said the culprit in the curse-killings was <STYLE ID="5">Dad</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Naturally, <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE> didn't take it well.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜死にかけ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, come on..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... Just something."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"So the culprits really are </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... That's not it. There might be proof the two of them aren't the culprits, so I'm looking. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">If I find it, they're not the culprits."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh, okay! I hope you find it!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Though if I find it, it's settled that they're the culprits...<PG>
It didn't seem to be here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That leaves the room <STYLE ID="5">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE> share.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, I'm going up to the second floor, so tell me if anyone comes."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="3">"Wait, I'm coming too! There's still time before the two of them get back!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\幸太郎の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "4" "2000" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\夕焼け.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I don't come into this room much.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Around the time <STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE> died, I was given a room of my own.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It wasn't because <STYLE ID="6">Mom's</STYLE> room had come free, but out of consideration for my growing into a woman.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It looked very different from the way I remembered <STYLE ID="5">Dad's</STYLE> room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the time since I'd last seen it, he'd apparently rearranged it over and over.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"So the proof that </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> isn't the culprit is in here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... Well..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The decisive proof―the book taken out of the storehouse.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I find it here, it is hard proof that <STYLE ID="5">Dad</STYLE> has been deceiving everyone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But at this rate, I'll end up making <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE> search for that proof.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">listen."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Should I be honest with her here, after all?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE> is trying to find the book to prove <STYLE ID="5">Dad</STYLE> innocent.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If things go on like this, <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE> will gladly help look for the book.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But that will end in a result <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE> doesn't want.<PG>
I want to cover for <STYLE ID="5">Dad</STYLE> too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But at this rate, the next curse-killing will happen.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the 'someone' that kept <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="だま">deceiving</STYLE> us will go on <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="むしば">eating away at</STYLE> the Arata settlement, more or less forever.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, this is important, so please listen. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">About what I'm looking for right now..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh! Come to think of it, I never asked what you're looking for!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... Probably an old book. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">An old book from the storehouse, somewhere in this room."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Got it! If we find that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is cleared of everything!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... That book should explain how to solve the curse-killings."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I'd explained that much, <STYLE ID="3">Kana's</STYLE> face began to cloud over a little.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hmm? Then </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> must know how to solve it, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE> seemed to have caught on too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yes―if my guess is right, far from knowing the solution, <STYLE ID="5">Dad</STYLE> may be deeply involved in the case.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"I get it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. It's the other way around. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">If the book doesn't turn up, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is innocent, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Don't worry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. Even if I find the book, I won't hide it or anything. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">No matter how much I want to think </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> isn't the culprit, that won't change the facts."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"At New Year's, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, when I </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="けんか">fought</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> with you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> told me something. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> really want to solve the case, she said, so you said </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was the culprit even though you didn't want to. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">And since the culprit is inside the settlement, it could be anyone. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">If </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> really is doing something bad, we have to make him stop."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, did you tell anyone what you talked about with </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"As if I would. I don't want to tell anybody about something like this."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE> seemed to have found her resolve too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We're trying to prove <STYLE ID="5">Dad's</STYLE> innocence and expose his guilt at the same time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which way it falls, we'll find out by searching this room.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"But </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, if it's that risky a book, wouldn't </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> throw it away somewhere instead of hiding it in his room?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... That book must have something very important written in it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">So </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> wouldn't throw it away that easily."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Then what about hiding it in the mountains or something?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... If he did that, the book would get ruined, wouldn't it?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　Besides, animals might get into it."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I see..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no guarantee <STYLE ID="5">Dad</STYLE> acts by the same values I do.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But if I were in <STYLE ID="5">Dad's</STYLE> place, I'd want to keep it somewhere as safe as possible instead of throwing it away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And a place only he goes into.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh well! Let's hurry up and look, before </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and Grandma get back."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
Kana opened the closet and started sticking her head into the darkness.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have to look too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE>'s taking the closet, so...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\夏菜の机.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
What I had my eye on was <STYLE ID="3">Kana's</STYLE> desk.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is <STYLE ID="5">Dad's</STYLE> room, but it's <STYLE ID="3">Kana's</STYLE> room too, so I have to go through both their things.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For all I know, <STYLE ID="5">Dad</STYLE> hid it in <STYLE ID="3">Kana's</STYLE> territory.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手前バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Wait, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! You're going through my desk!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> might have hidden it in </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> desk, right? At the back of a drawer, somewhere you don't usually look."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">"W-w-w-w-wait! I have a right to privacy too, don't I!?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... But that's exactly why I have to look―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Bad_Luck.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"No, no, no! If dirty magazines turned up in my desk, you wouldn't know how to react, right!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, you have stuff like that?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"No, no, no, it's just an example!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... At this point, whatever I find, I'll pretend I didn't see it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
And when I pulled the top drawer of <STYLE ID="3">Kana's</STYLE> desk―<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... It's locked..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手前バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="11">"See!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">　See!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　It's locked, so you can't look, right!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... The one who locked it was </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　Or could you be hiding evidence tied to the curse-killings?"</STYLE>
